Three-dimensional vortex shedding behind a cylinder
---------------------------------------------------

In this example, vortex shedding is observed in compressible flow behind a
cylinder at Reynolds number Re = 3900. The example is large and should be run
on a parallel machine with sufficient memory and processors.

Please ensure the CMake option NEKTAR_USE_MPI is enabled when compiling
Nektar++.

   mpirun -n 128 CompressibleFlowSolver Cylinder_NS_3D.xml.gz conditions.xml
